{
  "title": "大盘支撑已到，下周看全面反弹",
  "author": "顶底之王",
  "publish_time": "",
  "url": "http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUxODM4ODM5Mg==&mid=2247487025&idx=1&sn=7e004aad5a24309455c699599a255b78&chksm=f8f6f8f1b9ff6701e2cdead44a1a406e935a2d41850ea53e4073deb4746f79555a5279588bb7&scene=27#wechat_redirect",
  "content_text": "大盘支撑已到，而且是所有指数同步到支撑。\n除了上证指数微破了低点，但现在各指数板块都是分化的，上证指数作为一个综合性的指数已经没太多意义。\n现在科创50是支撑，沪深300是支撑，创业板是支撑。\n半导体、医药、消费、地产、农业养殖都是支撑。\n科技和低估值老登板块都有机会，下周应该会出普反。\n但是普反完毕后，很可能会再次分化。\n创业板低点已经被跌破，仅仅只能按反弹看待。科创50也是一样。\n而低估值老登板块都是底部企稳，小波段上涨趋势，大概率会延续走上涨趋势。\n这也贴合上证指数破位的情况。\n也就是先普反一波。\n然后低估值老登板块继续上涨，而科技反弹后会再下跌。\n因为科技的权重大，低估值权重小，科技下跌的权重大于低估值上涨的权重。\n所以上证指数也会被科技带着继续往下走。\n后面的情况走一步看一步，先看这波超跌普反再说。\n刘广义\nA0260626040026\n投资有风险 入市需谨慎\n个人观点 仅供参考\n案例截图不做投资依据\n上海中广云证券咨询有限公司",
  "content_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \"><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">大盘支撑已到，而且是所有指数同步到支撑。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">除了上证指数微破了低点，但现在各指数板块都是分化的，上证指数作为一个综合性的指数已经没太多意义。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">现在科创50是支撑，沪深300是支撑，创业板是支撑。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">半导体、医药、消费、地产、农业养殖都是支撑。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">科技和低估值老登板块都有机会，下周应该会出普反。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">但是普反完毕后，很可能会再次分化。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">创业板低点已经被跌破，仅仅只能按反弹看待。科创50也是一样。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">而低估值老登板块都是底部企稳，小波段上涨趋势，大概率会延续走上涨趋势。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">这也贴合上证指数破位的情况。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">也就是先普反一波。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">然后低估值老登板块继续上涨，而科技反弹后会再下跌。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">因为科技的权重大，低估值权重小，科技下跌的权重大于低估值上涨的权重。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">所以上证指数也会被科技带着继续往下走。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">后面的情况走一步看一步，先看这波超跌普反再说。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style='-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;'><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bol